# What the OIDF conformance suite's own scripts/requirements.txt
# (gitlab.com/openid/conformance-suite, master) lists. The conformance
# workflow installs the hash-pinned compilation of this file,
# requirements-suite.txt, never the suite's unpinned list. To refresh
# it, after checking the suite's list still matches this one:
#
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras \
#     --no-emit-index-url --output-file conformance/requirements-suite.txt \
#     conformance/requirements-suite.in
httpx
pyparsing
